# Rust
/rust/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# rust/Cargo.lock is COMMITTED: reproducible CI (cargo test/clippy/check run
# with --locked) and --locked packaging; the dev-dependency (serde_json) stays
# pinned. The lock is ignored by Cargo when this repo is consumed as a
# dependency, so it has zero effect on library users.

